# ROS 2 tier4_map_msgs messages in the JSON form of a rosbridge `publish` operation.
# Generated by tools/gen/ros2msg2pack.py; do not edit by hand.
# One kind per .msg file, selected by the member `type` ("<package>/msg/<Name>").
# The ROS message is the object under `msg`; arrays are groups.
format        ros2-tier4-map-msgs
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "ROS 2 interface package tier4_map_msgs, https://github.com/tier4/tier4_autoware_msgs tier4/universe (Apache License 2.0) at commit efa4129394ad0b83a1de6c6d90ad937d74e9e426, directory tier4_map_msgs/msg; field names, types and array forms only"
source        "ROS 2 interface package geographic_msgs (messages tier4_map_msgs refers to), https://github.com/ros-geographic-info/geographic_info jazzy at commit 24806adc767414eb3a34a58aefeb648ee415b09a, BSD License (package.xml)"
source        "rosbridge v2.1.0 Protocol Specification, ROSBRIDGE_PROTOCOL.md, https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite jazzy at commit cb33a16b890e4b8d9def531326409f3ee6c12537, BSD 3-Clause License; JSON form of a message and of the publish operation"
uses          ros2tier4map
wire          json
when   op  publish
field  ros2tier4map.topic  topic  string

kind      map_projector_info
when      type  tier4_map_msgs/msg/MapProjectorInfo
requires  ros2tier4map.map_projector_info_projector_type
field  ros2tier4map.map_projector_info_projector_type  msg.projector_type  string
field  ros2tier4map.map_projector_info_vertical_datum  msg.vertical_datum  string
field  ros2tier4map.map_projector_info_mgrs_grid  msg.mgrs_grid  string
field  ros2tier4map.map_projector_info_map_origin_latitude  msg.map_origin.latitude  float
field  ros2tier4map.map_projector_info_map_origin_longitude  msg.map_origin.longitude  float
field  ros2tier4map.map_projector_info_map_origin_altitude  msg.map_origin.altitude  float
